# mutmut's sandbox: a full copy of the tree with every mutant inlined, left
# behind untracked by `mutmut run` (see setup.cfg [mutmut]). It used to be
# deleted by hand after each run; ignoring it means `git add -A` cannot commit
# ~1,100 mutated copies of backend/history_query.py by accident.
mutants/
media_cache/
saved_media/
history.db*

# Runtime config (split stores — migrated from the old single config.json)
config/
config.json
config.json.migrated-*
